  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>巨人生成（Giant Spawn）是一个简约且可配置的模组，允许巨人自然生成。每当僵尸生成时，有概率变成巨人，默认几率为 1/20，且仅限地表。模组还基于僵尸 AI 为巨人添加了自定义 AI。<br><br></p>\n<p>你可能还对以下模组感兴趣：<span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/skeleton-horse-spawn\"><strong>骷髅马生成</strong></a>&nbsp;</span>或&nbsp;<span><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-horse-spawn\">僵尸马生成</a></strong></span>。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于原版体验整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/spawn-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的生成包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>chanceSurfaceZombieIsGiant</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.05，最小值 0，最大值 1.0<br>地表生成的僵尸变为巨人的概率。<br><br><span><strong>shouldBurnGiantsInDaylight</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>启用后，巨人暴露在日光下会燃烧。<br><br><span><strong>onlySpawnGiantOnSurface</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>启用后，巨人仅会在地表生成。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>giantMovementSpeedModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0，最大值 20.0<br>巨人相较于基础僵尸移动速度的倍率。<br><br><span><strong>giantAttackDamageModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 2.0，最小值 0，最大值 20.0<br>巨人相较于基础僵尸攻击伤害的倍率。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>巨人使用自定义 AI 移动：<br></strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/giant-spawn/a.webp\" alt=\"巨人移动\" width=\"1000\" height=\"540\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，前提是下载链接保持位于 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。感谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
